{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21357","headline":"黄明府诗 · 元稹","name":"黄明府诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年曾痛饮，黄令苦飞觥。\n席上当时走，马前今日迎。\n依稀迷姓氏，积渐识平生。\n故友身皆远，他乡眼暂明。\n便邀连榻坐，兼共榜船行。\n酒思临风乱，霜棱埽地平。\n不堪深浅酌，贪怆古今情。\n逦迤七盘路，坡陁数丈城。\n花疑褒女笑，栈想武侯征。\n一种埋幽石，老闲千载名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}